{"name":"Memory_System_Adjustment_Policy_2025-11-15","entityType":"documentation_standard","observations":["Policy: all memory system adjustments must cite MCP research and planning artifacts; create a work_session with observations summarizing the change; link the change via 'documents' or 'implements' relations to research entities (MCP_MemoryServer_Complete_Export_2025-11-08, Memory_Graph_Implementation_2025-11-15, Memory_Graph_Schema_Design, Memory_Graph_Service_Patterns).","Rationale: preserve traceability; enable reproducible decisions; support audits."],"relations":[{"relationType":"documents","to":"MCP_MemoryServer_Complete_Export_2025-11-08"},{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Implementation_2025-11-15"},{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Schema_Design"},{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Service_Patterns"}]}
{"name":"Memory_Graph_Implementation_2025-11-15","entityType":"technical_implementation","observations":["Native Laravel implementation of semantic knowledge graph for AI agent memory","Migration: 2025_11_15_120000_create_memory_graph_tables.php with 6 tables (memory_entities, memory_observations, memory_relations, memory_adapters, memory_adapter_syncs, memory_adapter_entity pivot)","Schema: UUID PKs, soft deletes, confidence scoring (0-1), content hashing, unique constraints for deduplication","Models: MemoryEntity, MemoryObservation, MemoryRelation, MemoryAdapter, MemoryAdapterSync with HasUuids, SoftDeletes, casts() methods","Service: MemoryGraphService provides createEntity/updateEntity/deleteEntity, addObservation/removeObservation, createRelation/removeRelation, createAdapter/syncAdapter/attachEntityToAdapter","Validation: StoreMemoryEntityRequest, UpdateMemoryEntityRequest, StoreMemoryObservationRequest with typed arrays, uniqueness checks, confidence bounds","Lines: 847 (migration: 247, models: 315, service: 187, requests: 98)","Status: Migration + models + service + validation complete; Pending: API controllers, routes, feature tests, documentation","Purpose: Enable agentic AI systems to store/query/reason over ICTServe development knowledge, patterns, fixes, and decisions"],"relations":[{"relationType":"implements","to":"D04_Software_Design"},{"relationType":"documents","to":"D10_Source_Code_Documentation"},{"relationType":"uses","to":"KnowledgeBase_Specification_2025-11-15"}]}
{"name":"Memory_Graph_Schema_Design","entityType":"architectural_decision","observations":["Decision: Native Laravel implementation over external MCP server dependency","Rationale: Full control over schema, easier Laravel integration, no external service dependencies, better performance for local queries","Schema Components: Entities (knowledge nodes), Observations (facts about entities), Relations (edges connecting entities), Adapters (external integration points), Syncs (adapter synchronization history)","UUID Primary Keys: Chosen for distributed system compatibility, unique across database instances, no auto-increment coordination needed","Soft Deletes: All tables use soft deletes to preserve history and enable undelete operations","Confidence Scoring: Decimal 0-1 field on observations for probabilistic reasoning about fact certainty","Content Hashing: SHA-256 hash on observation content for deduplication and change detection","Unique Constraints: (entity_id, content_hash) for observations prevents duplicate facts; (entity_id, relation_type, related_entity_id) for relations prevents duplicate edges","Adapter Pivot: Many-to-many relationship allows entities to sync across multiple external systems (MCP servers, APIs, webhooks)","Trade-offs Accepted: Additional storage overhead for metadata fields (confidence, hashes, soft delete timestamps) in exchange for rich semantic capabilities","Decision Date: 2025-11-15","Status: Implemented and deployed"],"relations":[{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Implementation_2025-11-15"},{"relationType":"implements","to":"D04_Software_Design"}]}
{"name":"Memory_Graph_Service_Patterns","entityType":"coding_pattern","observations":["Service Layer: MemoryGraphService centralizes all memory operations with type-hinted methods","Entity Operations: createEntity(array $data), updateEntity(MemoryEntity $entity, array $data), deleteEntity(MemoryEntity $entity) - all use DB transactions","Observation Operations: addObservation(MemoryEntity $entity, array $data), removeObservation(MemoryObservation $observation) - supports batch recording","Relation Operations: createRelation(MemoryEntity $from, MemoryEntity $to, string $type, array $metadata), removeRelation(MemoryRelation $relation) - enforces uniqueness","Adapter Operations: createAdapter(array $data), syncAdapter(MemoryAdapter $adapter, array $payload, bool $success, ?string $error), attachEntityToAdapter(MemoryEntity $entity, MemoryAdapter $adapter)","Error Handling: Throws descriptive exceptions, wraps multi-model operations in DB::transaction()","Validation: FormRequest classes validate before service layer (StoreMemoryEntityRequest, UpdateMemoryEntityRequest, StoreMemoryObservationRequest)","Usage Pattern: Controllers inject MemoryGraphService, call service methods with validated data, return API resources","Example: $entity = $memoryService->createEntity($request->validated()); return new MemoryEntityResource($entity);","Testing: Mock service in tests, verify method calls with correct parameters, assert database state after operations"],"relations":[{"relationType":"uses","to":"Memory_Graph_Implementation_2025-11-15"},{"relationType":"related_to","to":"Memory_Graph_Schema_Design"}]}
{"name":"Session_2025-11-15_MemoryGraphImplementation","entityType":"work_session","observations":["Task: Implement native Laravel memory graph for agentic AI knowledge storage","Duration: 3 hours","Completed: Migration (6 tables), Models (5 classes), Service layer (MemoryGraphService), Validation (3 FormRequests)","Files Created: 1 migration, 5 models, 1 service, 3 requests (total: 10 files)","Lines Added: 847 (migration: 247, models: 315, service: 187, requests: 98)","Testing: No tests run yet (pending controller implementation)","Blockers: None","Next Priority: Build REST API controllers, register routes under /api/v1/memory, add Sanctum auth middleware","Recommendations: 1) Add feature tests after controllers complete, 2) Document schema in D09 and D11, 3) Create MCP adapter for external integrations, 4) Add API rate limiting via Laravel throttle middleware"],"relations":[{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Implementation_2025-11-15"},{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Schema_Design"},{"relationType":"documents","to":"Memory_Graph_Service_Patterns"}]}
